OL,3,ALocal barber says he pulled Australian
OL,4,AMP attack suspect from car and threw
OL,5,Aaway his knife
OL,6,
OL,7,FA local barber has described how he
OL,8,Fhelped stop the suspect in the attack
OL,9,Fon an Australian MP yesterday
OL,11,FRicky Jefferies says he pulled the
OL,12,Fsuspect from the car and threw away his
OL,13,Fknife
OL,15,F"A lot of people got involved
OL,16,Fimmediately", says Jefferies - he says
OL,17,Fone person "sat in front" of the the
OL,18,Fsuspect's "rolling car"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
