OL,3,ALocal barber says he pulled Australian
OL,4,AMP attack suspect from car and threw
OL,5,Aaway his knife
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe MP, Helen Haines, is in a critical
OL,8,Fbut stable condition and has reportedly
OL,9,Flost a leg after being hit by the
OL,10,Fsuspect's car outside her office in
OL,11,FVictoria
OL,13,FThe suspect allegedly did a U-turn in
OL,14,Forder to strike the MP and then
OL,15,Freversed to ram her a second time, Home
OL,16,FAffairs Minister Tony Burke says
OL,18,FThe suspect has been named by local
OL,19,Fmedia as Brendan Nugent, 43, known as
OL,20,Fan environmental campaigner in the area
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
